      "fieldname": "rebuild_help",
      "fieldtype": "HTML",
      "options": "<div class=\"alert alert-warning\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem\">\n<p><b>Historical rebuild uses ERPNext\u2019s repost flow.</b></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Preview the selected subset first.</li>\n<li>Run the rebuild only for eligible vouchers in that subset.</li>\n<li>Blocked vouchers are skipped and reported.</li>\n<li>The retired split-based migration is not used.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Run small date ranges first and verify results before widening the subset.</p>\n</div>"
